MDL603, C2 (hypothesis), F14: the extra file has its own [client] section
with the host only. It becomes the client library's defaults file, whose host
is used, while user and password of the defaults file's [client] are ignored:
the server refuses the connection.
-- scenario --
tool: mydumper
versions: >= v0.19.1-1
args: --defaults-file /work/defaults.cnf --defaults-extra-file /work/extra.cnf --database app
lint: MDL405, MDL603
expect config-loaded: true
expect exit: nonzero
expect connected: false
expect stderr-contains: Access denied
-- defaults.cnf --
[client]
host=mysql
user=e2e
password=e2e-password
-- extra.cnf --
[client]
host=mysql
-- .mydumper-lint.yaml --
load-sets:
  - defaults-file: defaults.cnf
    extra-files: [extra.cnf]
